<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#0A1626' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 120, padding: '24px 64px', borderBottom: '1px solid #1E3A5F' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 500, color: '#E8F0FA' }}>第 7 章 · 飞控慢速档（简述）</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#9DB4CE', marginTop: 6 }}>与实时控制解耦的维护任务，频率越低越靠后</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 540, padding: '22px 64px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
    {[['Duty_20ms','scheduler.c:125','ANTO_polling() — 经 USART3 向上位机输出数据'],
      ['Duty_50ms','scheduler.c:134','PilotLED() 灯效 / Flag_Check() 传感器标志 / Voltage_Check() 电压'],
      ['Duty_1000ms','scheduler.c:147','信号强度统计、视觉/光流模块在位检测']].map((d,i)=>(
      <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#0F1E33', padding: '14px 22px', borderRadius: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#4A90D9', fontWeight: 700, fontFamily: 'monospace', width: 220 }}>{d[0]}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7E94AE', width: 200, fontFamily: 'monospace' }}>{d[1]}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#9DB4CE', flex: 1 }}>{d[2]}</Text>
      </Box>
    ))}
    <Box style={{ background: '#0F1E33', borderLeft: '4px solid #00D1FF', padding: '12px 20px', borderRadius: 8, marginTop: 2 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#E8F0FA', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
        一句话带过即可：这些是慢速维护任务，<span style={{ color: '#00D1FF', fontWeight: 700 }}>与控制闭环完全解耦</span>。
      </Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 60, padding: '0 64px', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7E94AE' }}>飞控+遥控 代码讲解（30min）</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7E94AE' }}>12 / 22</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
